1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,870
I'm...

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:07,270
scared of everyone finding out that I'm "Mai".

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,630
I'm not confident

4
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,830
I'm a girl that matches your level.

5
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,900
I…

6
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,510
do not know what to do.

7
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,480
But...

8
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,210
I don't want you to hate me.

9
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:36,180
Like I'd ever hate you.

10
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:40,280
Having you love me like this, is more than enough.

11
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:45,030
Aiko... Aiko, let's keep this all a secret,

12
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:47,840
until you're ready to tell everyone

13
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,660
- that you're "Mai".
- Okay.

14
00:01:09,410 --> 00:01:11,240
Sorry about the wait.

15
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,800
- What are you looking at?
- Huh?

16
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,520
- The weather for tomorrow.
- Oh...

17
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:17,520
I thought some girl was texting you.

18
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,600
No way.

19
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:24,900
Hey. What do you think of Aiko Kasumi?

20
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:27,990
- Oh, that girl that looks like a boy?
- Yeah.

21
00:01:28,630 --> 00:01:32,230
I don't like her. She's a nosy busybody.

22
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:39,440
I see. I'm glad you guys could make up.

23
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:43,770
Me too. I'm super happy!

24
00:01:43,770 --> 00:01:48,710
Would you let me ride that happy wave and tell you something?

25
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,540
Thank you, Ai.

26
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:57,860
I'm officially dating that guy.

27
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,140
Hey! Ritsuki!
<i>[Kasumi]</i>

28
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:08,980
If you make Hiroko cry, I'll never forgive you!

29
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:11,010
What are you, her dad?

30
00:02:11,010 --> 00:02:13,180
- What's all this fuss about?
- Did something happen?

31
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:16,790
- This creep got involved with a high schooler!
- No, no...

32
00:02:16,790 --> 00:02:18,880
It's just platonic between us.

33
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:21,300
You might call it a chaste relationship of kindred souls—

34
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:23,120
- Shut up!
- He's totally guilty.

35
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,410
Tip off the cops.

36
00:02:24,410 --> 00:02:28,050
You don't get involved with your little sister's friends!

37
00:02:28,050 --> 00:02:31,140
No matter what you say, it's fine.

38
00:02:31,930 --> 00:02:34,080
Because I'm serious.

39
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:41,650
I'm serious about Hiroko.

40
00:02:41,650 --> 00:02:45,330
You should worry more about yourself, Sis.

41
00:02:45,330 --> 00:02:47,860
My business has nothing to do with you.

42
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:50,850
Listen up. Dating wasn't ever the goal.

43
00:02:50,850 --> 00:02:52,800
It was the starting line.

44
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:56,170
This is the start of the real game.

45
00:02:56,170 --> 00:02:57,560
A game?

46
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,390
He totally dodged the subject.
<i>(T/N: dodge = ronten)</i>

47
00:03:00,390 --> 00:03:02,470
<i>Ronten</i>? Like the jelly?

48
00:03:02,470 --> 00:03:04,180
That would be <i>kanten.
(T/N: kanten = agar jelly)</i>

49
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,900
Now get this...

50
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:11,550
Can I tell you the greatest test that's awaiting you?

51
00:03:11,550 --> 00:03:13,910
I'm super curious! What is it?

52
00:03:14,990 --> 00:03:17,050
Your part-time job!

53
00:03:17,050 --> 00:03:21,190
Crap! Text me when he tells you.

54
00:03:21,190 --> 00:03:23,770
I'm not interested!

55
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:29,520
Ritsuki, don't fill her head with weird ideas.

56
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,500
- Your hamburger.
- What?

57
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:34,630
What came over me?!

58
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:38,270
I'm just thinking about our sister's future here.

59
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:47,110
What's... the test?

60
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:53,000
The great test will be...

61
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,010
you.

62
00:03:55,010 --> 00:03:56,550
Me?

63
00:03:56,550 --> 00:04:00,840
Hiroko told me. You're keeping Mai a secret, huh?

64
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,720
So what?

65
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:05,700
Your boyfriend is a popular guy.

66
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:10,050
Can you watch in silence while girls fawn over him in front of you?

67
00:04:10,050 --> 00:04:11,380
I'll be fine!

68
00:04:11,380 --> 00:04:15,310
That secret is a pretty substantial test.

69
00:04:15,310 --> 00:04:19,020
I told you, I'll be fine!

70
00:04:26,610 --> 00:04:30,550
<i>[Ai-Chan's Secret | Episode 4]</i>

71
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:49,050
All right, time for a match!

72
00:04:49,050 --> 00:04:50,340
Yeah, fine by me.

73
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:52,200
Okay, stop!

74
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:54,120
- You can't.
- Why not?!

75
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:57,630
- Boys and girls are having separate training sessions today.
- Huh?!

76
00:04:57,630 --> 00:05:00,230
Come on, come on. Let's go, Reo!

77
00:05:00,230 --> 00:05:03,080
Okay! This way, Kasumi.

78
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:05,750
What?!

79
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:08,740
32... 33...

80
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:12,690
- 34... 35...
- Don't slow down, girls! Be like Kasumi!

81
00:05:12,690 --> 00:05:14,350
36...

82
00:05:14,350 --> 00:05:16,370
Ai? Are you all right?

83
00:05:16,370 --> 00:05:19,720
I'm fine!

84
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:23,520
I'm fine! Stupid test...

85
00:05:31,860 --> 00:05:33,950
Excuse me, ladies.

86
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:36,840
Great work today, Reo!

87
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,410
It's fine!

88
00:05:38,410 --> 00:05:42,190
- That's all right...
- Why not? It's fine!

89
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:50,540
You sure have a big appetite, Reo.

90
00:05:50,540 --> 00:05:52,260
I'll make food for you next time.

91
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,610
- No thank you.
- Why not?

92
00:05:53,610 --> 00:05:55,670
She's unbelievable...

93
00:05:55,670 --> 00:05:59,650
- Does his girlfriend know?
- If she did, wouldn't she fight over him?

94
00:05:59,650 --> 00:06:01,930
Let's go tell his maid girlfriend about it.

95
00:06:01,930 --> 00:06:03,950
Good idea!

96
00:06:03,950 --> 00:06:06,790
Ai?

97
00:06:06,790 --> 00:06:09,640
Oh, Erena. Want my rice ball?

98
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,560
Are you sure?

99
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,150
Thank you!

100
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:26,880
It's almost like I can hear you deflating.

101
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:36,100
Reo will always be surrounded by girls like that, huh?

102
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:44,130
When you fall in love, some things become painful.

103
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:48,790
That's true. Things are different from they were before.

104
00:06:49,860 --> 00:06:52,520
But there's also

105
00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:56,500
a happiness you've never felt before, right?

106
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:03,110
I wonder...

107
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:04,910
But in your case,

108
00:07:04,910 --> 00:07:09,900
it must hurt not being able to tell everyone you're Reo's girlfriend.

109
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:22,140
Maybe I'm not fine, after all.

110
00:07:26,930 --> 00:07:29,830
Will you stop keeping the secret?

111
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:42,450
I'll always support you.

112
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,520
And your secret.

113
00:07:52,420 --> 00:07:54,820
♫ <i>What awaits in this battle of love?</i> ♫

114
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:56,700
Thank you.

115
00:07:56,700 --> 00:07:58,160
♫ <i>It seems it won't end in a draw</i> ♫

116
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:01,110
♫ <i>You hated loosing,</i> ♫

117
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:04,880
♫ <i>So I won't let you go easy on me</i> ♫

118
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:07,730
Reo!

119
00:08:07,730 --> 00:08:09,860
Let's walk home together!

120
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:15,500
- Reo!
- Reo!

121
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:20,360
- I want to walk home with you!
- Let's come with you!

122
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:24,370
♫ <i>I want to steal you away
The secret that belongs to only us. 1on1</i> ♫

123
00:08:24,370 --> 00:08:26,200
You look like you're going to cry.

124
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:28,130
♫ <i>I make you acting like a kid with just a sweet kiss</i> ♫

125
00:08:28,130 --> 00:08:30,140
You smiled so much before.

126
00:08:30,140 --> 00:08:33,320
Is there something bothering you?

127
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,600
No, there's not.

128
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:38,740
How long have you been there, anyway?

129
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,820
You're a funny girl.

130
00:08:42,830 --> 00:08:46,020
When I think you're going to smile, you almost start crying.

131
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:48,820
And now you're angry.

132
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:52,520
Buzz off. Don't talk to me.

133
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:56,940
♫ <i>Lips to exchange</i> ♫

134
00:08:59,990 --> 00:09:02,730
It's hopeless!

135
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:07,530
I have to be my usual Aiko-self so they don't find out my secret!

136
00:09:38,130 --> 00:09:40,140
<i>[I'm going to Spica tomorrow.]</i>

137
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:42,920
<i>[Let's make time to hang out by ourselves.]</i>

138
00:09:44,450 --> 00:09:51,200
<i>[That'd make me so happy!]</i>

139
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,700
<i>Great work today!</i>

140
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:54,560
<i>I'll make food for you next time.</i>

141
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:56,870
<i>Let's walk home together!</i>

142
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:07,140
<i>[DON'T come.]</i>

143
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:10,320
<i>[Why not?]</i>

144
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:15,840
<i>[Because! See you tomorrow. Night.]</i>

145
00:10:22,540 --> 00:10:24,520
Oh! Looking for Mai?

146
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:27,840
Would I be here for any other reason?

147
00:10:29,690 --> 00:10:33,850
There's a girl that looks a lot like Mai, right?

148
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:38,460
Might be funny to tease her about it.

149
00:10:38,460 --> 00:10:40,120
What are you trying to say?

150
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,810
Nothing.

151
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:46,140
I just find you two very entertaining.

152
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,730
Thank you.

153
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:08,470
Why did you come?

154
00:11:08,470 --> 00:11:10,110
Forget that. You need to be careful.

155
00:11:10,110 --> 00:11:12,610
You're the one who needs to be careful.

156
00:11:12,610 --> 00:11:15,480
Takumi might've realized who you are.

157
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,990
There's no way.

158
00:11:21,260 --> 00:11:22,980
Are you angry?

159
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:26,040
I mean, I told you not to come.

160
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,100
Ikumi's trying to go after you.

161
00:11:28,100 --> 00:11:31,910
- I told you, Morikawa—
- Reo!

162
00:11:33,430 --> 00:11:35,320
Did you call for me?

163
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,810
No, he didn't.

164
00:11:36,810 --> 00:11:40,020
I wasn't asking you, Mai!

165
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:42,900
I see...

166
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:48,190
Oh? I guess Mai surrendered you to me!

167
00:11:48,190 --> 00:11:50,500
- I don't think so.
- Huh?

168
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:56,810
It's weird to see you not fight.

169
00:11:58,570 --> 00:12:01,170
<i>- Whoopsie!
- Oh my god, I'm so sorry!</i>

170
00:12:01,170 --> 00:12:06,880
<i>Ikumi gets misunderstood by girls, so I have to protect her.</i>

171
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:11,890
I think she's been through a lot.

172
00:12:11,890 --> 00:12:14,480
So I can't be too hard on her.

173
00:12:16,470 --> 00:12:18,800
I love that about you, Ai.

174
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:22,910
What are you doing? Come on...

175
00:12:23,820 --> 00:12:26,220
Reo wants another coffee.

176
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:28,000
- I'll take care of it.
- No, I will.

177
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,040
- No, I will.
- I will!

178
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:32,470
Relax, you guys!

179
00:12:34,060 --> 00:12:38,260
Tough luck! More customers have arrived.

180
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:47,100
She's so softhearted.

181
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:51,010
Welcome ho— no way!

182
00:12:51,010 --> 00:12:54,170
- How adorable!
- This place is so cute!

183
00:12:54,170 --> 00:12:55,610
What's the matter?!

184
00:12:55,610 --> 00:12:59,150
- Oh, Reo!
- We came, too!
- I've never been to a maid cafe!

185
00:12:59,150 --> 00:13:02,280
- The coffee is really good here.
- Sounds great!

186
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:04,770
You'll have to introduce us to Mai!

187
00:13:04,770 --> 00:13:07,530
- Introduce?
- Where is Mai?

188
00:13:07,530 --> 00:13:10,720
Oh! There she is!

189
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:13,430
Why are you here, Morikawa?!

190
00:13:13,430 --> 00:13:17,950
You're bothering the other guests, so could you please keep it down?

191
00:13:17,950 --> 00:13:22,070
What? You're such a pain. The maid look is ugly on you.

192
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:26,490
Why are you always where Reo is?

193
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:28,650
This is bad. Ikumi is alone with those girls.

194
00:13:28,650 --> 00:13:32,190
You stay here for now. I'll figure something out.

195
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:34,990
Take care of Ai.

196
00:13:34,990 --> 00:13:36,620
Take care of...?

197
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:39,820
It's rude to Mai!

198
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:43,520
- But I'm worried!
- Just hide! It'd be bad if they found out, right?

199
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,150
Yeah, but...

200
00:13:45,150 --> 00:13:46,680
I'll go out there too, okay?

201
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:50,460
- You're with Reo way too much!
- Yeah, way too much!

202
00:13:50,460 --> 00:13:52,820
And that maid outfit looks like crap on you!

203
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:55,620
Just calm down, you guys. You too, Morikawa.

204
00:13:55,620 --> 00:13:59,500
They're so scary! Please help me, Reo!

205
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:02,390
Let go of him!

206
00:14:10,250 --> 00:14:12,500
Quiet.

207
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:15,030
I have an idea.

208
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:19,290
What's going on? An argument?

209
00:14:19,290 --> 00:14:23,160
Ritsuki, could you take off your clothes?

210
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:25,720
What are you talking about?

211
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,590
- Why are you helping her?
- Listen...

212
00:14:27,590 --> 00:14:30,100
- She's just taking advantage of you!
- Where is Mai, anyway?

213
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:32,870
- That's enough. We're in a cafe.
- But...

214
00:14:32,870 --> 00:14:37,320
And anyway, who I date is none of your business.

215
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,380
Well, Morikawa needs to get her paws off!

216
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:42,230
- Right!
- Get off now!

217
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:50,580
Miss, I'm afraid we can't have a racket in the store.

218
00:14:50,580 --> 00:14:52,070
Let go of me. What is this?

219
00:14:52,070 --> 00:14:55,340
Please don't use your beautiful hands for something like this.

220
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:57,220
He's a butler?

221
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:02,060
I'm terribly sorry for my maid's rudeness.

222
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:06,770
I will attend to your any wish today, my lady.

223
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:13,750
I'm sorry.

224
00:15:13,750 --> 00:15:16,470
- He's amazing!
- Super handsome!

225
00:15:16,470 --> 00:15:19,800
He pulled it off.

226
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:22,320
<i>[Maid Cafe | Spica]</i>

227
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:29,160
I think the first-aid kit is around here.

228
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:32,960
Could you hurry it up? We'll be here until morning.

229
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:36,260
Sorry. I'll go ask about it.

230
00:15:46,170 --> 00:15:48,730
Hey, do you know where the first-aid kit is?

231
00:15:48,730 --> 00:15:51,830
Ritsuki put it away last time, but...

232
00:15:51,830 --> 00:15:53,220
Ugh! Where is he?

233
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:55,620
Tidying up outside with Reo.

234
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:58,230
Getting full use out of him, huh?

235
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:03,820
Thanks for today.

236
00:16:03,820 --> 00:16:08,030
I know you were probably just helping Ikumi, but...

237
00:16:08,030 --> 00:16:11,360
No. I did it for you.

238
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:15,840
I wanted to protect you, Mai.

239
00:16:18,310 --> 00:16:22,070
How slick! You must be popular with girls.

240
00:16:22,990 --> 00:16:29,000
But I know you really did it to protect Ikumi.

241
00:16:31,580 --> 00:16:33,380
That's true.

242
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:35,830
You two must be really close.

243
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:39,560
I'm sure Ikumi is happy to have you protecting her.

244
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:44,190
I would do anything for her.

245
00:16:51,490 --> 00:16:54,020
Here it is. The thing you were looking for.

246
00:16:54,020 --> 00:16:55,770
Thanks.

247
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:03,780
Sorry for having you help me clean up.

248
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:06,750
I can't do a thing about people issues, though.

249
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,760
Sorry.

250
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:13,430
It is a mystery. You don't have trouble with the ladies. Why Aiko?

251
00:17:13,430 --> 00:17:15,220
There's other fish in the sea, right?

252
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:19,350
To me, Aiko is the best.

253
00:17:19,350 --> 00:17:21,520
Ikumi's pretty cute, huh?

254
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:23,150
I think she's way better than Aiko—

255
00:17:23,150 --> 00:17:26,220
I'm not interested in anyone else.

256
00:17:26,220 --> 00:17:29,120
Well, if that's true...

257
00:17:31,010 --> 00:17:33,500
then don't make her worry.

258
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:40,220
Okay.

259
00:17:40,220 --> 00:17:42,560
What are you talking about?

260
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:44,120
Boobies.

261
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,750
- Apparently, Reo likes them big!
- What?

262
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:49,230
Are you trying to pick a fight?

263
00:17:54,780 --> 00:17:57,790
I'm sorry about today.

264
00:17:57,790 --> 00:17:59,900
I couldn't protect you.

265
00:18:01,690 --> 00:18:03,280
It's fine.

266
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:10,250
I want to sit down and have a talk with Morikawa.

267
00:18:11,050 --> 00:18:14,970
- To tell her Mai is really Aiko?
- No, not that.

268
00:18:14,970 --> 00:18:17,490
What she wants will never come true.

269
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,530
I'll go tell her that.

270
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:33,610
Okay.

271
00:18:34,910 --> 00:18:36,830
I'll wait for you.

272
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:59,090
Took your sweet time!

273
00:19:00,250 --> 00:19:01,450
Reo.

274
00:19:01,450 --> 00:19:03,350
You seem well.

275
00:19:04,770 --> 00:19:09,200
Mai is really nice, huh? Surrendering you to me again.

276
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:12,810
I would never give you up to anyone.

277
00:19:12,810 --> 00:19:15,620
She must not like you all that much, huh?

278
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:17,610
Mai is

279
00:19:19,020 --> 00:19:21,070
in love with me.

280
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,820
Whoa... You're awfully confident, aren't you?

281
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:27,620
If she didn't love me, I would be in big trouble.

282
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:29,580
Why is that?

283
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:43,400
Because

284
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:46,980
I really, really love Mai.

285
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:55,100
So, Morikawa—

286
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:57,250
Please,

287
00:19:57,250 --> 00:19:59,370
don't say any more.

288
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,470
I mean,

289
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:06,320
I haven't done anything yet.

290
00:20:10,870 --> 00:20:13,500
Stop holding out hope for me.

291
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:50,460
What's wrong?

292
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:52,370
I want him.

293
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:56,010
I want Reo!

294
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:58,860
So?

295
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:00,890
What should I do?

296
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:07,020
An amusement park?! Let's go, let's go!

297
00:21:07,020 --> 00:21:09,050
You don't have work next Saturday, right?

298
00:21:09,050 --> 00:21:10,800
- I don't have basketball, either.
- That's great!

299
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:12,680
I can't wait!

300
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:16,090
- What do you want to ride?
- Well, I want a hot dog...

301
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:17,910
And a crepe...

302
00:21:17,910 --> 00:21:19,710
- Those are foods.
- Huh?

303
00:21:19,710 --> 00:21:21,410
- What rides?
- Rides?

304
00:21:21,410 --> 00:21:24,200
Rides? Let's go on a roller coaster!

305
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:26,860
- Yeah. Let's do it.
- Yeah!

306
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:30,430
Seduce Mai.

307
00:21:35,830 --> 00:21:38,220
I understand.

308
00:21:38,220 --> 00:21:40,900
<i>[Next time]
Dates are super fun, aren't they? </i>

309
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:42,320
<i>Found you!</i>

310
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:44,690
<i>Ikumi is trying to steal your boyfriend.</i>

311
00:21:44,690 --> 00:21:47,510
<i>I'm fine with half of what Mai has, so please love me.</i>

312
00:21:47,510 --> 00:21:50,050
<i>Morikawa could probably become an ideal girlfriend.</i>

313
00:21:50,050 --> 00:21:53,060
<i>If you're serious, Ikumi, I'll accept your challenge.
[This drama is a work of fiction]</i>
